ENTITY CX5A
QUALIFY CX5A kind context
QUALIFY CX5A type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX5A base_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX5A distinguishes_type tau_A
QUALIFY CX5A member A1
QUALIFY CX5A member A2
QUALIFY CX5A member A3

ENTITY CX5V
QUALIFY CX5V kind context
QUALIFY CX5V type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX5V base_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX5V distinguishes_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX5V member V1
QUALIFY CX5V member V2
QUALIFY CX5V member V3
QUALIFY CX5V member V4
QUALIFY CX5V member V5
QUALIFY CX5V member V6
QUALIFY CX5V member V7

ENTITY CX5
QUALIFY CX5 kind context
QUALIFY CX5 type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX5 base_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX5 distinguishes_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V1
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V2
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V3
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V4
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V5
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V6
QUALIFY CX5 member A1V7
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V1
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V2
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V3
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V4
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V5
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V6
QUALIFY CX5 member A2V7
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V1
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V2
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V3
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V4
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V5
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V6
QUALIFY CX5 member A3V7

ENTITY U11
QUALIFY U11 kind stream
QUALIFY U11 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U11 I0 A1V7
AT U11 I1 A2V6
AT U11 I2 A3V5

ENTITY U12
QUALIFY U12 kind stream
QUALIFY U12 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U12 I0 A3V6
AT U12 I1 A1V5
AT U12 I2 A2V4

ENTITY U13
QUALIFY U13 kind stream
QUALIFY U13 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U13 I0 A1V5
AT U13 I1 A2V4

ENTITY T5
QUALIFY T5 kind task
QUALIFY T5 context CX5
QUALIFY T5 input U11
QUALIFY T5 input U12
QUALIFY T5 input U13

UNKNOWN_AT T5 X5 U13 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

CONSTRAINT COMPONENT_RELATION C5V U13 2 RVdown
QUALIFY T5 constraint C5V
